WEBVTT

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:31.620
wax yar oo nolosheeda ku saabsan

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:33.916
iyo farshaxankayga

00:00:33.916 --> 00:00:39.459
HP:(Hadal Shiinees ah)

00:00:39.459 --> 00:00:42.583
YR: Waxan ku dhashay kuna soo koray meel u dhaw Manchester,

00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:43.550
ee Wadanka Ingiriiska

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:47.122
Laakin English ma idinkula hadlaayo,

00:00:47.122 --> 00:00:49.883
maxaa yeelay waxan iska ilaalinayaa wax malo ah

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:52.965
taaso la is oran karo waxa keentay lahjadeyda reer waqooyiga.

00:00:52.965 --> 00:00:55.540
(Qosol)

00:00:55.540 --> 00:01:04.975
HP:(Hadal Shiinees ah)